msgstr "Asistent skončil: %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: The menu that hands the selected mail to Claude Desktop or Claude Code, and its settings group.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:470
msgid "Assistant"
msgstr "Asistent"

#. TRANSLATORS: Heading above the choice between Claude Desktop and Claude Code.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:472
msgid "Open In"
msgstr "Otevřít v"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:473
msgid "Set Up the Assistant…"
msgstr "Nastavit asistenta…"

#. TRANSLATORS: In the menu of an attachment: hands the file to Claude.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:475
msgid "Ask the Assistant…"
msgstr "Zeptat se asistenta…"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:476
msgid "Show the Assistant Menu"
msgstr "Zobrazovat nabídku Asistent"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:477
msgid ""
"Hands the selected mail to Claude Desktop or Claude Code with a prepared "
"question; nothing is sent until you send it there"
msgstr ""
"Předá vybranou poštu do Claude Desktop nebo Claude Code s připraveným "
"dotazem; nic se neodešle, dokud ho tam neodešlete"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:513
msgid "Restart Claude Desktop?"
msgstr "Restartovat Claude Desktop?"

#. TRANSLATORS: "this change" is the switch Register with Claude, just flipped.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:515
msgid ""
"Claude Desktop loads MCP servers only when it starts, and while it runs it "
"overwrites this change. Malachi Mail can quit it, make the change and start "
"it again."
msgstr ""
"Claude Desktop načítá MCP servery jen při spuštění a dokud běží, tuto změnu "
"přepíše. Malachi Mail ho může ukončit, změnu zapsat a znovu ho spustit."

#. TRANSLATORS: A button: quits Claude Desktop, makes the change and starts Claude Desktop again.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:517
msgid "Restart Claude Desktop"
msgstr "Restartovat Claude Desktop"

#. TRANSLATORS: A button: makes the change now; Claude Desktop picks it up when it restarts.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:519
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Později"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:520
msgid "Claude Desktop picks up the change when it restarts"
msgstr "Claude Desktop změnu načte po restartu"

#. TRANSLATORS: A button in the row "Claude Desktop picks up the change when it restarts": restarts Claude Desktop.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:522
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "Restartovat"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:523
msgid "Claude Desktop did not quit"
msgstr "Claude Desktop se neukončil"

#. TRANSLATORS: Placeholder of the assistant panel's question field.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:574
msgid "Ask about your mail…"
msgstr "Zeptejte se na svou poštu…"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:575
msgid "What should the reply say?"
msgstr "Co má odpověď říct?"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:576
msgid "What do you want to know?"
msgstr "Co chcete vědět?"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:577
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Zastavit"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:578
msgid "New Conversation"
msgstr "Nový rozhovor"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:579
msgid "A draft is ready"
msgstr "Koncept je připravený"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:580 ui/internal/board/text.go:347
msgid "Open Draft"
msgstr "Otevřít koncept"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:581
msgid "The draft is no longer there"
msgstr "Koncept už neexistuje"

#. TRANSLATORS: A bar in the assistant panel: the conversation is about other mail than the message selected in the list.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:583
msgid "Another message is selected"
msgstr "Vybrali jste jinou zprávu"

#. TRANSLATORS: A button of the bar "Another message is selected": the assistant may talk about that message too.
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:585
msgid "Add to Conversation"
msgstr "Přidat do rozhovoru"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:587 ui/internal/board/triage.go:32
msgid "Claude Code is not signed in"
msgstr "Claude Code není přihlášený"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:588
msgid "The Malachi Mail tools are not available to the assistant"
msgstr "Asistent nemá k dispozici nástroje Malachi Mail"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:589
msgid "The conversation was stopped"
msgstr "Rozhovor byl zastaven"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:590
msgid "Mail you ask about is sent to Claude under your account"
msgstr "Pošta, na kterou se ptáte, se posílá do Claude pod vaším účtem"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:591
msgid "Send Mail to Claude?"
msgstr "Poslat poštu do Claude?"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:592
msgid ""
"The assistant reads the messages you ask about and sends their content to "
"Anthropic under your Claude account. Messages may contain instructions from "
"their senders: the assistant is told not to follow them, and it cannot send, "
"move or delete anything."
msgstr ""
"Asistent si přečte zprávy, na které se ho zeptáte, a jejich obsah odešle "
"společnosti Anthropic pod vaším účtem Claude. Zprávy mohou obsahovat pokyny "
"od odesílatelů: asistent je nemá plnit a nemůže nic odeslat, přesunout ani "
"smazat."

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:593
msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Povolit"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:594
msgid "Show Assistant"
msgstr "Zobrazit asistenta"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:595
msgid "Hide Assistant"
msgstr "Skrýt asistenta"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:596
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:597
msgid "Choose…"
msgstr "Vybrat…"

#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:599
msgid "Not signed in"
