#. List, Columns, Today) the board opens in.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:426
msgid "Board View"
msgstr "Zobrazení nástěnky"

#. TRANSLATORS: a choice of Settings → General → Board (Board View,
#. Open at Launch): what the user had last.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:434
msgctxt "board setting"
msgid "Last Used"
msgstr "Naposledy použité"

