#. opens on Mail, on the Board, or on what was shown last.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:451
msgid "Open at Launch"
msgstr "Při spuštění otevřít"

#. TRANSLATORS: Settings → General → Board: a switch.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:469
msgid "Show the Board"
msgstr "Zobrazovat nástěnku"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:474
msgid ""
"Sorts your conversations into what needs you, what waits for others and what "
"is only for reading. Turned off, your decisions are kept."
msgstr ""
"Třídí konverzace na to, co čeká na vás, co čeká na ostatní, a co je jen pro "
"informaci. Když ji vypnete, vaše rozhodnutí zůstanou zachována."

#. TRANSLATORS: Settings → General → Board: a group of rows, one per
#. state, each followed by a number of days.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:482
msgid "Keep cases for"
msgstr "Ponechat případy po dobu"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:487
msgid ""
"A case leaves the board when its newest message is older than this, unless "
"your decision, a reminder or a deadline keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Případ z nástěnky zmizí, když je jeho nejnovější zpráva starší, pokud ho "
"nedrží vaše rozhodnutí, připomenutí nebo termín."

#. TRANSLATORS: how long a state of the board keeps a case.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:493
#, c-format
msgid "%d day"
msgid_plural "%d days"
msgstr[0] "%d den"
msgstr[1] "%d dny"
msgstr[2] "%d dní"

#. TRANSLATORS: the sender of the user's own messages in a conversation.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:499
msgid "You"
msgstr "Vy"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a number of messages, such as "3 messages".
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:506
#, c-format
msgid "Conversation · %s"
msgstr "Konverzace · %s"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:510
msgid "Deadlines"
msgstr "Termíny"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:514
msgid ""
"No deadlines. The assistant finds deadlines in the text of messages and "
"keeps the sentence each one comes from."
msgstr ""
"Žádné termíny. Termíny z textu zpráv doplňuje asistent a ke každému ukládá "
"větu, ze které pochází."

#. TRANSLATORS: a tile of the Today page: the promises the assistant
#. found in the user's replies.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:521
msgid "Promised"
msgstr "Slíbené"

#. TRANSLATORS: spoken by the screen reader; %s is a deadline's day,
#. such as "Tomorrow" or "20 Oct".
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:528
#, c-format
msgid "Due %s"
msgstr "Termín: %s"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:536
msgid "Has attachments"
msgstr "Obsahuje přílohy"

#. TRANSLATORS: spoken by the screen reader for a case with unread mail.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:541
msgctxt "board row"
msgid "Unread"
msgstr "Nepřečteno"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:550
msgid ""
"The newest message is marked as important, addressed to you and from a "
"sender you have written to."
msgstr ""
"Nejnovější zpráva je označená jako důležitá, je adresovaná vám a poslal ji "
"někdo, komu jste už psali."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:552
msgid "You flagged a message in this conversation."
msgstr "Zprávu v této konverzaci jste označili příznakem."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:554
msgid "The newest message is addressed to you by a sender you have written to."
msgstr ""
"Nejnovější zpráva je adresovaná vám a poslal ji někdo, komu jste už psali."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:556
msgid "The newest message answers one of yours."
msgstr "Nejnovější zpráva odpovídá na některou z vašich."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:558
msgid "You replied last; the next step is theirs."
msgstr "Naposledy jste odpověděli vy; další krok je na nich."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:560
msgid "You asked a question and wait for the answer."
msgstr "Položili jste otázku a čekáte na odpověď."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:562
msgid "You are only in Cc on the newest message."
msgstr "V nejnovější zprávě jste jen v kopii."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:564
msgid "The message is not addressed to you (a mailing list or a Bcc)."
msgstr "Zpráva není adresovaná vám (konference nebo skrytá kopie)."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:566
msgid "A note to yourself."
msgstr "Poznámka pro sebe."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:568
msgid ""
"The newest message is addressed to you by someone you have never written to."
msgstr ""
"Nejnovější zpráva je adresovaná vám od někoho, komu jste nikdy nepsali."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:570
msgid ""
"The newest message comes from someone you have never written to and is not "
"addressed to you, so it waits under For Your Information."
msgstr ""
"Nejnovější zpráva je od někoho, komu jste nikdy nepsali, a není adresovaná "
"vám, proto čeká v části Pro informaci."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:572
msgid "Your comment is the latest in the issue; the next step is theirs."
msgstr "Váš komentář je v úkolu nejnovější; další krok je na nich."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:574
msgid "Someone wrote in an issue assigned to you."
msgstr "Někdo napsal do úkolu, který je přiřazený vám."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:576
msgid "Someone wrote in an issue you reported."
msgstr "Někdo napsal do úkolu, který jste zadali."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:578
msgid "Someone wrote in an issue you commented on."
msgstr "Někdo napsal do úkolu, který jste komentovali."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:580
msgid "You only watch this issue."
msgstr "Tento úkol jen sledujete."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:582
msgid ""
"The rules would no longer list it; your choice, a reminder, a deadline or a "
"promise keeps it here."
msgstr ""
"Pravidla by ho už nezařadila; drží ho tu vaše volba, připomenutí, termín "
"nebo slib."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:589
msgid "A reminder you set has come due."
msgstr "Nastal čas připomenutí, které jste nastavili."

#. TRANSLATORS: under "Why is this here?" when the user moved the case
#. to its state; "it" is the case.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:597
msgid "Your decision keeps it on the board."
msgstr "Drží ho vaše rozhodnutí."

#. TRANSLATORS: a badge on a case of the board that came back because a
#. reminder the user set came due.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:605
msgctxt "board badge"
msgid "Reminded"
msgstr "Připomenuto"

#. TRANSLATORS: a badge on a case of the board: its sender is someone
#. the user has never written to.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:613
msgctxt "board badge"
msgid "New contact"
msgstr "Nový kontakt"

#. TRANSLATORS: a name and a short badge after it, such as "Work
#. (IMAP)" or "Offer (Reminded)".
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:625
#, c-format
msgid "%s (%s)"
msgstr "%s (%s)"

#. TRANSLATORS: the line under a case's title on the board: the other
#. party and the date, such as "Jana Nováková · 2 Oct 2026 14:05".
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:637
#, c-format
msgid "%s · %s"
msgstr "%s · %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: a day and a time of day, such as "Thu at 18:00",
#. "Tomorrow at 09:00" or "20 Oct at 09:00".
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:645
#, c-format
msgid "%s at %s"
msgstr "%s v %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: the tooltip of the Today page's tile of promises;
#. %s is the tile's title ("Promised").
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:654
#, c-format
msgid "%s: %d promise"
msgid_plural "%s: %d promises"
msgstr[0] "%s: %d slib"
msgstr[1] "%s: %d sliby"
msgstr[2] "%s: %d slibů"

#. TRANSLATORS: the tooltip of a tile of the Today page; %s is a state
#. of the board, such as "Hot", %d how many cases are in it.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:658
#, c-format
msgid "%s: %d case"
msgid_plural "%s: %d cases"
msgstr[0] "%s: %d případ"
msgstr[1] "%s: %d případy"
msgstr[2] "%s: %d případů"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:662
msgid "The daemon’s rules put the case here."
msgstr "Případ sem zařadila pravidla démona."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:683
msgid "Loading the Board…"
msgstr "Načítá se nástěnka…"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:685
msgid "Preparing the Board…"
msgstr "Připravuje se nástěnka…"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:689
msgid "Board Unavailable"
msgstr "Nástěnka není dostupná"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:691
msgid "The Board Is Off"
msgstr "Nástěnka je vypnutá"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:705
msgid "The board needs a running mail backend."
msgstr "Nástěnka vyžaduje běžícího poštovního démona."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:707
msgid "The board could not be loaded. Malachi Mail tries again shortly."
msgstr "Nástěnku se nepodařilo načíst. Malachi Mail to brzy zkusí znovu."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:711
msgid ""
"The board is turned off in the settings. Your decisions are kept for when it "
"is on again."
msgstr ""
"Nástěnka je v Předvolbách vypnutá. Vaše rozhodnutí zůstanou zachovaná pro "
"chvíli, kdy ji znovu zapnete."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:723
msgid "The mail backend is not running: the board shows what it knew last."
msgstr "Poštovní démon neběží: nástěnka ukazuje poslední známý stav."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:725
msgid ""
"The board could not be loaded: it shows what it knew last. Malachi Mail "
"tries again shortly."
msgstr ""
"Nástěnku se nepodařilo načíst: ukazuje poslední známý stav. Malachi Mail to "
"brzy zkusí znovu."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:730
msgid "Only the newest 1,000 cases are on the board."
msgstr "Na nástěnce je jen 1000 nejnovějších případů."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:736
msgid "This mail backend has no board. A newer Malachi Mail backend brings it."
msgstr ""
"Tento poštovní démon nástěnku nemá. Přinese ji novější démon Malachi Mail."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:740
msgid ""
"Malachi Mail is sorting your mail for the first time. This takes a minute or "
"two."
msgstr "Malachi Mail poprvé třídí vaši poštu. Potrvá to minutu nebo dvě."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:746
msgid "The assistant’s notes are out of date: the conversation changed since."
msgstr "Poznámky asistenta jsou zastaralé: konverzace se mezitím změnila."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:751
msgid "Loading the conversation…"
msgstr "Načítá se konverzace…"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:754
msgid "The conversation could not be loaded."
msgstr "Konverzaci se nepodařilo načíst."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:757 ui/internal/window/assistant_panel.go:669
#: ui/internal/window/status.go:324 ui/data/ui/window.ui:433
msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Zkusit znovu"

#. TRANSLATORS: spoken by the screen reader before a title or a reason
#. the assistant wrote; %s is that text.
#: ui/internal/board/text.go:768
#, c-format
msgid "Assistant: %s"
msgstr "Asistent: %s"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:772
msgid "Show in Mail"
msgstr "Zobrazit v Poště"

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:777
msgid "Show in Mail failed: the message is no longer on the server."
